 "nl": [
  "Deny all traffic from printers to dev-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "Allow ntp-servers to connect to iot-sensors using DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Allow research to connect to iot-sensors using NTP (UDP 123).",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) on ntp-servers reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Make HTTPS (TCP 443) and HTTP (TCP 80) on nvr reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Restrict nvr so that its only permitted destinations are ntp-servers on HTTPS (TCP 443); research on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "research must accept PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from printers.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach iot-sensors over RDP (TCP 3389) and SMB (TCP 445)."
